{
  "name": "Paginator",
  "kind": "component",
  "component": "HottyPaginator",
  "icon": "more_horiz",
  "description": "Pages, as bubbles' paginator turns them. Fruit is a List of 22, four to a page: the paginator holds it (its child) and shows one page of it, then a dot for each page, the one shown the brightest; the last page, of two, keeps the others' height, so the dots stay put. The arrows left and right, h and l, and Page Up and Page Down turn the pages; Home and End go to the first and the last; a click on a dot goes to its page. The page is written to /fruitPage, from 1. Search results are the agent's: it holds twelve pages and sends them one at a time, so the paginator has no child, only pages, shown as numbers (displayStyle numbers). A turn writes /results/page and sends search with it, which the agent would answer with that page's results; this story has no agent, so they stay. The help line is a HottyKeyHints.",
